# 2. Walk the current function body to find all assignments to that object
# 3. For each assignment that has a CallExpr as RHS (or part of RHS), record it
# 4. Apply ignoreSigs etc. to determine if it's "safe"
# 5. If any assignment has a "safe" (suppressed) call -> variable is safe -> don't flag
# 6. If all call assignments are from same package -> not flagged (unless reportInternalErrors)
# 7. If all call assignments are from external -> flag with LAST external sig

# For multi-return: `_, err = someFunc()` 
# The RHS is the call expression, and err is one of the LHS vars.
# I need to get the signature of the ENTIRE call, not just the error type.

